# Overlay run set for the linuxmatters page.
# Format: col row fgHex rank text. text runs to end of line.
# rank is the stacking rank, 0 being front-most.
# Foreground is chosen per run to contrast with its local background.
4 2 FFFFFF 0 Text Size 8px
4 6 FFFFFF 1 Text Size 12px
4 10 FFFFFF 2 Text Size 16px
60 4 FFFFFF 3 Text Size 20px
60 8 FFFFFF 4 Text Size 24px
60 12 000000 5 Text Size 28px
